                <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;flowchart TB\n\n%%================================================\n%% User Layer\n%%================================================\nsubgraph UL[\&quot;User Layer\&quot;]\n    USER[\&quot;👤 User\&quot;]\nend\n\n%%================================================\n%% Application Layer\n%%================================================\nsubgraph AL[\&quot;Application Layer\&quot;]\n    FE[\&quot;🖥️ Frontend Dashboard\&quot;]\n    BE[\&quot;⚙️ Backend Server\&quot;]\n    DB[(\&quot;🗄️ MySQL Database\&quot;)]\nend\n\n%%================================================\n%% Communication Layer\n%%================================================\nsubgraph CL[\&quot;Communication Layer\&quot;]\n    ESP[\&quot;📡 ESP8266 Gateway\&quot;]\nend\n\n%%================================================\n%% Embedded Layer\n%%================================================\nsubgraph EL[\&quot;Embedded Layer\&quot;]\n\ndirection TB\n\nsubgraph SM[\&quot;Sensor Module\&quot;]\n    TEMP[\&quot;🌡️ Temperature Sensor\&quot;]\n    HUM[\&quot;💧 Humidity Sensor\&quot;]\n    LIGHT[\&quot;💡 Light Sensor\&quot;]\nend\n\nSTM[\&quot;STM32 Controller\&quot;]\n\nsubgraph AM[\&quot;Actuator Module\&quot;]\n    RELAY[\&quot;Relay Module\&quot;]\n    FAN[\&quot;🌀 Fan\&quot;]\n    LAMP[\&quot;💡 Light\&quot;]\n    BUZZER[\&quot;🔔 Buzzer\&quot;]\nend\n\nend\n\n%%================================================\n%% Connections\n%%================================================\n\nUSER --&gt; FE\n\nFE --&gt; BE\n\nBE --&gt; DB\n\nBE &lt;--&gt; ESP\n\nESP &lt;--&gt; STM\n\nTEMP --&gt; STM\nHUM --&gt; STM\nLIGHT --&gt; STM\n\nSTM --&gt; RELAY\n\nRELAY --&gt; FAN\nRELAY --&gt; LAMP\nRELAY --&gt; BUZZER&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="R-zTsTbTd8j1Vn5hfmNn-1">
